kdominate: kdominate (tactical tile game)
kdominate:
kdominate: KDominate is a tactical game for one or two players, where players
kdominate: place and convert tiles with the goal of controlling the majority of
kdominate: the board. Each player starts with some tiles of their own on the
kdominate: board, and they can either clone a tile to an adjacent empty space, or
kdominate: jump with the tile to an empty position 2 spaces away. After cloning
kdominate: or jumping, all the adjacent enemy tiles become your own. The game
kdominate: ends when the board is full, and the winner is the player who owns
kdominate: more tiles.
